      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is still a small difference: The callbacks have the peer address while the DBus calls don\u0027t (and shouldn\u0027t). I\u0027d still prefer the current style - `xxx_impl` to handle the call state change and let the callbacks/DBus calls handle anything that involves LibBluetooth.",
