      "writtenOn": "2024-04-23T03:32:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can keep the additional `addr` play its role here by delegate to `dispatch_uhid_hfp_output_callback`\n\nE.g\n```\nif self.mps_qualification_enabled {\n  // prepare ID and data\n  self.dispatch_uhid_hfp_output_callback(addr, id, data);\n} else {\n  self.uhid_send_hook_switch_input_report(\u0026addr, true);\n}\n```\n\nIt just isn\u0027t right to have the below code duplicated with `answer_call`. Since both paths invoke the same operation in the end, they shall be merged.",
      "parentUuid": "841f31bf_f9390bc3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1003,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1006,
        "endChar": 17
